Description: Memory diagnostic tool for deepin 25
 A memory testing utility inspired by memtest86, designed for deepin 25
 systems. It performs various memory test algorithms (walking ones,
 moving inversions, block moves, random sequences, bit fade) to detect
 memory errors.
 .
 Features:
  * 9 memory test algorithms modeled on memtest86
  * Command line interface (CLI) mode
  * DTK6 graphical interface with live progress and error table
  * i18n: follows the system language (Chinese / English)
